{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐细节和情绪转折不如X细密，尤其少了随乐句出现的细微变化、声部互动和情绪层次。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y整体更适合边听边扫，左右分区让叙事和感受各有位置，句子也更完整地交代了人物的心理动因，尤其从害怕暴露心意、逐渐获得安全感，到开始期待、害怕失去，再到接受不确定性的过程，前后衔接比较自然。X的关键词放大加亮确实有利于迅速抓重点，而且按音乐时刻出现的感受词提供了更细腻的听觉体验，但不少段落的感受提示过于密集，意象也有些重复和交叉，容易让普通观众顾着辨认词语而错过人物主线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2c1bd41a-0599-4305-8bb7-0a5c241527f1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005959202612Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:01:52.505242+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f0a11f162bafe1e84d39b6158a3dda24ae5aacf956419de14387fe3cd87f1fe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp